{"overview":"وقتی در شهر کوچک «دِری» در ایالت مِین، کودکان یکی‌یکی ناپدید می‌شوند، گروهی از بچه‌ها با بزرگ‌ترین ترس‌های زندگی‌شان روبه‌رو می‌شوند — زمانی که باید با دلقکی قاتل به نام پنی‌وایز مقابله کنند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"In 1962, amid a spate of unexplained disappearances of local children, a group of misfit friends begin to suspect a long-buried ancient evil lurking. As the kids set out to determine what's really going on, a rising unease prompts several townspeople to work together to restore peace – all while a U.S. military operation seeks to exploit Derry for its own objectives.","tagline_en":"Go back to where IT all began.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":8,"y":2025,"poster":"/vij5NnWQsMnhT6sylaN9X3wjOkU.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":0,"y":null,"poster":""}],"episodes":8,"crew":["اندی موشیاتی","باربارا موشیتی","جیسون فوکس"],"crew_en":["Andy Muschietti","Barbara Muschietti","Jason Fuchs"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"تیلور پیج","role":"Charlotte Hanlon","photo":"/KTX1trmIfVa7MFkZmES1MVjl79.jpg","en":"Taylour Paige"},{"name":"Jovan Adepo","role":"Leroy Hanlon","photo":"/aJcuEbYru85meNGzM0oSeW3nsd6.jpg"},{"name":"جیمز رمار","role":"General Francis Shaw","photo":"/ctMVpFDKKWCty60lLORf3IoJcv9.jpg","en":"James Remar"},{"name":"Stephen Rider","role":"Hank Grogan","photo":"/hiBXBuspgPCsvX5jHJbxQUBZu8D.jpg"},{"name":"ماتیلدا لاولر","role":"Marge Truman","photo":"/uKioAyk7zSyO1BCOs5OQtNB4QNP.jpg","en":"Matilda Lawler"},{"name":"Amanda Christine","role":"Ronnie Grogan","photo":"/ytG5JgrniXLY6elImmzTKjvGtCZ.jpg"},{"name":"Clara Stack","role":"Lilly Bainbridge","photo":"/yMK3IADqV2oReJMKdkrcEIBxdtu.jpg"},{"name":"Blake Cameron James","role":"Will Hanlon","photo":"/qM3hkhRmqKVRVi1M9jd8sSEMjXf.jpg"},{"name":"Arian S. Cartaya","role":"Rich Santos","photo":"/dxL75wIa93im4GPeIHGZc9MosHt.jpg"},{"name":"Chris Chalk","role":"Dick Hallorann","photo":"/j8IpJkLTAhalh5Q356VNojcIAtx.jpg"}],"trailer":"u4JE2AyqDII","